        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Arthashastra</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 150 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Several authors over centuries; according to Olivelle, separate source treatises of 150 BCE to 50 CE, a compilation by a person named <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chanakya">Kautilya</a> in 50 to 125 CE and a major redaction between 175 and 300 CE; tradition names Chanakya, the counsellor of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chandragupta-maurya">Chandragupta Maurya</a></span></div>
